meta {
  name: List models
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/v1/models
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
}

docs {
  One of the endpoints this app answers synchronously rather than queueing
  (see also **Show model**, **Create embedding**, **Create moderation**).
  Proxies straight to the resolved gateway's upstream and normalises the
  answer into an OpenAI models list — `{ "object": "list", "data": […] }`
  — whatever the gateway's own protocol. Not rate limited, the same as
  every other read.

  Addressable under a gateway prefix too: `{{host}}/{{gateway}}/v1/models`
  lists that gateway's models instead of the default's.
}
